@host = http://localhost:5041

### 1. Normal transaction (should NOT be flagged)
POST {{host}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "ACC-1001",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "merchant": "Woolworths",
  "location": "Durban"
}

### 2. Large amount (should raise a High alert)
POST {{host}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "ACC-1001",
  "amount": 15000.00,
  "merchant": "Electronics Store",
  "location": "Durban"
}

### 3. Location change within 10 minutes (should raise a Medium alert)
POST {{host}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "ACC-1001",
  "amount": 300.00,
  "merchant": "Petrol Station",
  "location": "Johannesburg"
}

### 4. List all transactions
GET {{host}}/api/transactions

### 5. List all alerts
GET {{host}}/api/alerts